**314

!?FU(OnStackToStackDamage);
; Ignore invalid/theoretical calculations and melee attacks.
!!FU&x1<0:E;
!!FU&x2<0:E;
!!FU&x9<>0:E;
!!FU&x7<>1:E;

; Only creature 314.
!!BMx1:T?y1;
!!FU&y1<>314:E;

; Target must still exist/alive.
!!BMx2:N?y2;
!!FU&y2<=0:E;

; 20% proc chance.
!!VRy3:R100;
!!FU&y3>50:E;

; Remember defender stack ID before using more y variables.
!!VRy10:Sx2;

; Visual effect: native Roots/Dendroid binding animation.
!!BMx2:V68;

; Apply native Dendroid Bind. Duration is intentionally large because the
; engine ignores Bind duration; our OnCombatRound timer removes it explicitly.
!!BMx2:M72/999/3;

; Expire at the start of combat round current+3.
; Re-proccing refreshes the timer back to 3 rounds.
!!VRy4:Sv997+3;
!!SN:W^Bind314_%Y10^/y4;


; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; At the start of each visible combat round, remove Bind effects whose
; 3-round timer has expired.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!?FU(OnCombatRound);
!!DO(Bind314_CheckExpiry)/0/41/1:P;

!?FU(Bind314_CheckExpiry);
; x16 = battle stack index 0..41
!!SN:W^Bind314_%X16^/?y1;
!!FU&y1<=0:E;
!!FU&v997<y1:E;

; Clear our timer first so this cannot repeat even if the stack died.
!!SN:W^Bind314_%X16^/0;

; Dead/nonexistent stack: nothing else to do.
!!BMx16:N?y2;
!!FU&y2<=0:E;

; Remove native Roots effect by setting its active duration to zero.
!!FU(WOG_CleanUpSpells2):P72/x16;

; Small visual cue on release: Dispel animation.
!!BMx16:V41;


; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Battle lifecycle cleanup. Stack IDs 0..41 are reused every battle, so never
; carry timers from one combat into another.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!?BA0;
!!DO(Bind314_ClearTimer)/0/41/1:P;

!?BA1;
!!DO(Bind314_ClearTimer)/0/41/1:P;

!?FU(Bind314_ClearTimer);
!!SN:W^Bind314_%X16^/0;



